(7539390, 1206617, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very strong black and white.  Nice rhythm to the high key presentation flowing from the darker lower right, echoed in the flow of water on the beach and in the ocean.  The distant figures seem more imbued with quietude than were they closer, in my opinion, and despite the tension of nearby ominous, again in my opinion, industrialization.</td>', 'Very strong black and white.  Nice rhythm to the high key presentation flowing from the darker lower right, echoed in the flow of water on the beach and in the ocean.  The distant figures seem more imbued with quietude than were they closer, in my opinion, and despite the tension of nearby ominous, again in my opinion, industrialization.', '2017-10-16 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539392, 1206635, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific recipe for that quiet moment -  low clouds drifting through the trees and soft reflections on calm water, a unifying monotone gently vignetted and a poetic title.  Add a dash of eternity and there you have it.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Terrific recipe for that quiet moment -  low clouds drifting through the trees and soft reflections on calm water, a unifying monotone gently vignetted and a poetic title.  Add a dash of eternity and there you have it.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2017-10-16 17:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539393, 1206373, 173844, '<td valign="top">Both quiet and dramatic, as it''s hard to tell what this man is feeling in this scene of lovely, balanced contrasts.  He''s so shadowed that he''s as much a suggestion as a focal point, which makes this image so moving and intriguing.  Very fine.</td>', 'Both quiet and dramatic, as it''s hard to tell what this man is feeling in this scene of lovely, balanced contrasts.  He''s so shadowed that he''s as much a suggestion as a focal point, which makes this image so moving and intriguing.  Very fine.', '2017-10-16 17:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539398, 1206595, 173844, '<td valign="top">One can really feel the quiet and calm epitomized in this tucked away scene.  The woman, concentrated on her work, is perfectly revealed, picked out by the diffused light in the street or alleyway.  The sense of depth is pleasing.  Entirely charming and endearing.</td>', 'One can really feel the quiet and calm epitomized in this tucked away scene.  The woman, concentrated on her work, is perfectly revealed, picked out by the diffused light in the street or alleyway.  The sense of depth is pleasing.  Entirely charming and endearing.', '2017-10-16 18:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539399, 1206496, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait infused with a purity of emotion that pours directly from children''s hearts.  Left speechless by how fine this is.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait infused with a purity of emotion that pours directly from children''s hearts.  Left speechless by how fine this is.', '2017-10-16 18:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539400, 1206609, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene promising, as the sun settles towards dusk, the calm of evening and night.  The light is tender and embracing.  The structure where the fence terminates playfully suggests a window or door, but the viewer simply enters into the vista unencumbered and wholeheartedly.</td>', 'Lovely scene promising, as the sun settles towards dusk, the calm of evening and night.  The light is tender and embracing.  The structure where the fence terminates playfully suggests a window or door, but the viewer simply enters into the vista unencumbered and wholeheartedly.', '2017-10-16 18:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539401, 1206618, 173844, '<td valign="top">Peaceful scene, beautiful colors.  The ocean is fronted by these passageways through salt marsh or sandbars that mediate the transition from solid land and calm the force of nature a bit.  The slender trees, with their reflections and strange signs or boxes, offer a surrealistic touch.  I also enjoy the disposition of the ruffled water in the fore- and middle-ground.</td>', 'Peaceful scene, beautiful colors.  The ocean is fronted by these passageways through salt marsh or sandbars that mediate the transition from solid land and calm the force of nature a bit.  The slender trees, with their reflections and strange signs or boxes, offer a surrealistic touch.  I also enjoy the disposition of the ruffled water in the fore- and middle-ground.', '2017-10-16 19:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539402, 1206613, 173844, '<td valign="top">A child engrossed by nature is certainly at peace, which hopefully carries forward throughout his life.</td>', 'A child engrossed by nature is certainly at peace, which hopefully carries forward throughout his life.', '2017-10-16 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539403, 1206460, 173844, '<td valign="top">A beautiful, creamy confection that could well be a mandala to pacify our monkey mind.</td>', 'A beautiful, creamy confection that could well be a mandala to pacify our monkey mind.', '2017-10-16 19:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539404, 1206366, 173844, '<td valign="top">The text seems to be a sentiment drawn out of her self-possessed bearing, the wisdom of acceptance.  This seemingly simple image is an offering of depth and beauty.</td>', 'The text seems to be a sentiment drawn out of her self-possessed bearing, the wisdom of acceptance.  This seemingly simple image is an offering of depth and beauty.', '2017-10-16 19:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539411, 1206471, 50695, '<td valign="top">you are the quietest. 10</td>', 'you are the quietest. 10', '2017-10-16 23:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539418, 1206556, 173844, '<td valign="top">The solidity and seeming permanence of mountains induce quiet confidence, which in turn can lead to a sense of inner quiet. This particular mountain is indeed imposing.  It''s portrayed with winning delicacy, and gathers light with uplifting brilliance on its receptive flanks.  The clouds, too, are lovely.  An impressive image.</td>', 'The solidity and seeming permanence of mountains induce quiet confidence, which in turn can lead to a sense of inner quiet. This particular mountain is indeed imposing.  It''s portrayed with winning delicacy, and gathers light with uplifting brilliance on its receptive flanks.  The clouds, too, are lovely.  An impressive image.', '2017-10-17 08:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
