(7539462, 1206328, 173844, '<td valign="top">The sun seems to have found its way through the gloom to highlight these cows in a small pasture.  Nice quiet moment.</td>', 'The sun seems to have found its way through the gloom to highlight these cows in a small pasture.  Nice quiet moment.', '2017-10-17 13:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539463, 1206083, 173844, '<td valign="top">Water generously offers endless wondrous reflections that draw one in and invite reverie.  The busy world drops away, leaving time to quietly delight in the movement, the flickering forms and colors.  Leaving out color in this black and white allows appreciation of form and implicit movement.  The composition is quirky but balanced.  A handsome study.</td>', 'Water generously offers endless wondrous reflections that draw one in and invite reverie.  The busy world drops away, leaving time to quietly delight in the movement, the flickering forms and colors.  Leaving out color in this black and white allows appreciation of form and implicit movement.  The composition is quirky but balanced.  A handsome study.', '2017-10-17 13:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539464, 1206363, 173844, '<td valign="top">Extremely pretty, misty and moody.  There''s something so appealing about gathered dabs of color, in nature and otherwise.  My only quibble, and entirely subjective, is the presence of the background structure in the upper right.  It draws the eye away from the central focus.</td>', 'Extremely pretty, misty and moody.  There''s something so appealing about gathered dabs of color, in nature and otherwise.  My only quibble, and entirely subjective, is the presence of the background structure in the upper right.  It draws the eye away from the central focus.', '2017-10-17 13:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539468, 1206471, 173844, '<td valign="top">This rather open seascape softens boundaries, inviting one to relax into a waking dream, loosen expectations and idle in the quiet moments that follow.  Is it my imagination, a visual trick, or do I see the very slightest hint of pink/purple?  Whatever, this image certainly works for me.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'This rather open seascape softens boundaries, inviting one to relax into a waking dream, loosen expectations and idle in the quiet moments that follow.  Is it my imagination, a visual trick, or do I see the very slightest hint of pink/purple?  Whatever, this image certainly works for me.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2017-10-17 14:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539469, 1206486, 173844, '<td valign="top">A sweet visual surprise.  I''m smiling.  One pauses, enjoys and continues along, refreshed by the encounter.</td>', 'A sweet visual surprise.  I''m smiling.  One pauses, enjoys and continues along, refreshed by the encounter.', '2017-10-17 14:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539494, 1206616, 173844, '<td valign="top">Is quiet the same as calm?  Maybe not, hence my mixed feelings here, not calming but still.  And is still the same as quiet?  Better get off this train.  In any case, I like the image.  The geometry is appealing, as is the contrasting black and yellow -- which, being the warning colors of bees, is not entirely comforting.  Interesting.</td>', 'Is quiet the same as calm?  Maybe not, hence my mixed feelings here, not calming but still.  And is still the same as quiet?  Better get off this train.  In any case, I like the image.  The geometry is appealing, as is the contrasting black and yellow -- which, being the warning colors of bees, is not entirely comforting.  Interesting.', '2017-10-17 16:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539495, 1206602, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice quiet moment.  Time to stop and greet the new day.  The centered horizon, being a bit static, may actually be appropriate in an image that looks to be quiet.</td>', 'Nice quiet moment.  Time to stop and greet the new day.  The centered horizon, being a bit static, may actually be appropriate in an image that looks to be quiet.', '2017-10-17 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539496, 1206633, 173844, '<td valign="top">A peaceful moment, especially set against the beautiful bokeh.  It looks like this ladybug is climbing up the head of a snake, but probably not.</td>', 'A peaceful moment, especially set against the beautiful bokeh.  It looks like this ladybug is climbing up the head of a snake, but probably not.', '2017-10-17 16:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539497, 1206296, 19825, '<td valign="top">This is my first image in voting, and you have set the bar high.</td>', 'This is my first image in voting, and you have set the bar high.', '2017-10-17 16:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539498, 1206510, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful scene.  I like the layered composition and the pleasing palette.  While I like the cloud overhead, it may signal some future turbulence or, hopefully, for the sake of the challenge, gentle rain.</td>', 'Very peaceful scene.  I like the layered composition and the pleasing palette.  While I like the cloud overhead, it may signal some future turbulence or, hopefully, for the sake of the challenge, gentle rain.', '2017-10-17 17:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539499, 1206343, 173844, '<td valign="top">An interesting study, pleasing in composition.  I like the limited focus which gives it abstraction.</td>', 'An interesting study, pleasing in composition.  I like the limited focus which gives it abstraction.', '2017-10-17 17:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539503, 1206475, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice image, with the center highlighted to give the sense of calm within the darker surroundings.  The extensive gentle horizon also settles the mood.</td>', 'Nice image, with the center highlighted to give the sense of calm within the darker surroundings.  The extensive gentle horizon also settles the mood.', '2017-10-17 17:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539504, 1206612, 173844, '<td valign="top">Thoughtful evocation of morning''s quiet, even if the person who slept here is out climbing a mountain or something.</td>', 'Thoughtful evocation of morning''s quiet, even if the person who slept here is out climbing a mountain or something.', '2017-10-17 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539505, 1206474, 173844, '<td valign="top">Quiet, stylish portrait.  It''s simple and nicely lighted.</td>', 'Quiet, stylish portrait.  It''s simple and nicely lighted.', '2017-10-17 17:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539506, 1206571, 173844, '<td valign="top">What an amazing creature.  And it''s the quiet before the predatory flash of action.  It''s tension mingled with calm.  Nice image.</td>', 'What an amazing creature.  And it''s the quiet before the predatory flash of action.  It''s tension mingled with calm.  Nice image.', '2017-10-17 17:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539507, 1206482, 173844, '<td valign="top">This image is suffused with calm, at least until the bird strikes.  The lovely background greatly contributes to the quiet atmosphere.  Nice.</td>', 'This image is suffused with calm, at least until the bird strikes.  The lovely background greatly contributes to the quiet atmosphere.  Nice.', '2017-10-17 17:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539508, 1206482, 19825, '<td valign="top">Looks like the same Foggy Morning egret.</td>', 'Looks like the same Foggy Morning egret.', '2017-10-17 17:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539509, 1206614, 173844, '<td valign="top">The quiet here is made palpable by removing teacher, students or participants and all the voices.  Also the music, as evidenced by the music stand and piano.  It''s a clever way to evoke silence.  The visual pleasure, for me, is drawn from the rhythm of the empty chairs.</td>', 'The quiet here is made palpable by removing teacher, students or participants and all the voices.  Also the music, as evidenced by the music stand and piano.  It''s a clever way to evoke silence.  The visual pleasure, for me, is drawn from the rhythm of the empty chairs.', '2017-10-17 17:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539510, 1206296, 173844, '<td valign="top">Pretty, quiet corner of the night.  It looks like a stage set waiting for actors to make their entry.  Pleasing magical mood.</td>', 'Pretty, quiet corner of the night.  It looks like a stage set waiting for actors to make their entry.  Pleasing magical mood.', '2017-10-17 17:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539511, 1206369, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this is disquieting for me.  Maybe for him, maybe for other viewers, but uh-uh.  On the other hand it''s an interesting image.  Is it Yosemite?</td>', 'Sorry, but this is disquieting for me.  Maybe for him, maybe for other viewers, but uh-uh.  On the other hand it''s an interesting image.  Is it Yosemite?', '2017-10-17 17:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539512, 1206320, 173844, '<td valign="top">A pretty scene with fine focus all the way through.</td>', 'A pretty scene with fine focus all the way through.', '2017-10-17 17:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539513, 1206630, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting, colorful image of this part of a stadium after the action.  The quiet is extreme when contrasted to the roar of the crowd a short time ago.  Engaging... hope your team won.</td>', 'Interesting, colorful image of this part of a stadium after the action.  The quiet is extreme when contrasted to the roar of the crowd a short time ago.  Engaging... hope your team won.', '2017-10-17 18:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
