(7539533, 1206608, 173844, '<td valign="top">In the tropics even what''s quiet is vibrant, and what a way to start the day.  I like the lushness of the grass and trees, the slant of the boats'' masts and the purple sky and its reflection.</td>', 'In the tropics even what''s quiet is vibrant, and what a way to start the day.  I like the lushness of the grass and trees, the slant of the boats'' masts and the purple sky and its reflection.', '2017-10-17 18:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
