(7539685, 1206482, 47974, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes and comments, they are appreciated.<br/> <br/>I will have to say that I was surprised when I got up this morning.  With the score I had, I was sure I would end up in 4th-7th......................<br/> <br/>But it sure is a great way to kick of the first challenge with my new lens.</td>', 'Thanks for the votes and comments, they are appreciated. I will have to say that I was surprised when I got up this morning.  With the score I had, I was sure I would end up in 4th-7th...................... But it sure is a great way to kick of the first challenge with my new lens.', '2017-10-18 13:42:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7539719, 1206369, 14986, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by streetpigeon:</b></div><hr/><i> Sorry, but this is disquieting for me.  Maybe for him, maybe for other viewers, but uh-uh.  On the other hand it''s an interesting image.  Is it Yosemite? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes, Glacier Point at Yosemite.   This was just happenstance, not taken for a challenge.   I haven''t entered anything in several years, so decided to put a couple in.</td>', 'Originally posted by streetpigeon: Sorry, but this is disquieting for me.  Maybe for him, maybe for other viewers, but uh-uh.  On the other hand it''s an interesting image.  Is it Yosemite?   Yes, Glacier Point at Yosemite.   This was just happenstance, not taken for a challenge.   I haven''t entered anything in several years, so decided to put a couple in.', '2017-10-18 15:06:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7539732, 1206596, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that does meet the challenge<br/> <br/>A pleasing scene in which I think you have an essence of quietness but also a sense of tension waiting for that juggernaut to come rumbling around the bend and ruin the peace. The silver birch trees are very attractive and the leaves are a very pleasant autumnal pastel topping together with the lovely bendy road a pleasing composition. It is all quite pleasant and works to a degree. Thanks for your submission Russell.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that does meet the challenge A pleasing scene in which I think you have an essence of quietness but also a sense of tension waiting for that juggernaut to come rumbling around the bend and ruin the peace. The silver birch trees are very attractive and the leaves are a very pleasant autumnal pastel topping together with the lovely bendy road a pleasing composition. It is all quite pleasant and works to a degree. Thanks for your submission Russell.', '2017-10-18 16:59:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7539736, 1206482, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>Woah Ronnie, that egret done you plenty good again, congratulations. What a great entry, the long patient wait for both of you reflects a quiet atmosphere to its fullest. I have to agree this subdued image would seem to me to be far more fitting than the potential sunny image would have been. You must be well pleased with this but even more excited at the potential imagery you and your new lens have to look forward to!</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well Woah Ronnie, that egret done you plenty good again, congratulations. What a great entry, the long patient wait for both of you reflects a quiet atmosphere to its fullest. I have to agree this subdued image would seem to me to be far more fitting than the potential sunny image would have been. You must be well pleased with this but even more excited at the potential imagery you and your new lens have to look forward to!', '2017-10-18 17:07:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7539739, 1206482, 59029, '<td valign="top">Wow not too shabby...double ribbons in the same week with the same subject.  People sure loves them big white birds!  And congrats on the blue :-)</td>', 'Wow not too shabby...double ribbons in the same week with the same subject.  People sure loves them big white birds!  And congrats on the blue :-)', '2017-10-18 17:11:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7539741, 1206526, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>A very pleasing landscape with excellent still reflections, however, I find the right foreground really quite distracting. The small ripple at the base of the frame is also quite distracting. I think this would have been stronger if you could have excluded both of these perhaps by moving along to the right and pointing the camera down to crop most of the sky and include the water right up to the foreground thereby emphasising the feeling of space and also making the very most of those wonderful reflections.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well A very pleasing landscape with excellent still reflections, however, I find the right foreground really quite distracting. The small ripple at the base of the frame is also quite distracting. I think this would have been stronger if you could have excluded both of these perhaps by moving along to the right and pointing the camera down to crop most of the sky and include the water right up to the foreground thereby emphasising the feeling of space and also making the very most of those wonderful reflections.', '2017-10-18 17:14:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7539832, 1206609, 52549, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous scene, Ammie. Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Gorgeous scene, Ammie. Congrats on the ribbon.', '2017-10-19 14:43:05.000000', NULL, 0),
