(7540068, 1206343, 193128, '<td valign="top">Thank you for your compliments, everyone! <br/> <br/>StreetPigeon: Thank you for noticing that I was trying to be abstract :-). I like to take macro shots and fun camera angles.  <br/> <br/>Jomari: Thank you! <br/> <br/>Krnodil: Thank you for your kind words and welcome! I thought about entering it in the waterscape contest but didn''t think it would fare too well. Maybe I should have...</td>', 'Thank you for your compliments, everyone!  StreetPigeon: Thank you for noticing that I was trying to be abstract :-). I like to take macro shots and fun camera angles.   Jomari: Thank you!  Krnodil: Thank you for your kind words and welcome! I thought about entering it in the waterscape contest but didn''t think it would fare too well. Maybe I should have...', '2017-10-20 12:49:17.000000', NULL, 0);
